# The area map's battle zones and danger meter (tools/automap_test.py, docs/AUTOMAP.md), with the cheats on: the
# user's quick save battle-stuck (map 2 area 0, a field) loads at VI 100 (ELTALE_QUICK_LOAD_AT). M opens the full map,
# the left button is held on its "Battle zones" button (at 1280x960 its middle is about 496, 867) while W walks, then
# let go; B (the hold key) shows them again; M closes the map. tests/automap-zones-none.events is the same walk
# without the map, the mouse and B: the player walks the same.
5 key_down Return
7 key_up Return
300 key_down M
302 key_up M
320 pointer 496 867
340 mouse_down left
360 key_down W
400 key_up W
420 mouse_up left
450 key_down B
490 key_up B
520 key_down M
522 key_up M
